  "description": {
   "en": "Akihito committed a grave crime.\n\nPresumed sentence: 500 years in prison.\n\nTo him, the government proposed a system called the Criminal Transfer Program.\n\nUnder this program, a prisoner transfers to a troubled high school, and for each problem they resolve within the school, their sentence is reduced.\n\nNow, as a criminal transfer student, Akihito must face gangs, conspiracies, and the shadows of his own past."
  },
